260
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,410
You have to go looking.

261
00:06:43,410 --> 00:06:46,320
P.S. Don't stop anything
your doctor

262
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,850
has you on, and don't

263
00:06:47,850 --> 00:06:49,830
cancel anything on your
own.

264
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:51,520
Use the wrap a few weeks,

265
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,830
see what the knee does,

266
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,960
then go from there.

267
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:56,050
The point isn't to fight
your doctor.

268
00:06:56,050 --> 00:06:57,440
It's to treat the one
thing

269
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:59,700
the prescription pad and
the operating room

270
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,380
were never built to reach.

271
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:05,280
P.P.S. The guarantee
covers the whole window.

272
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,310
Most people notice the
change somewhere

273
00:07:07,310 --> 00:07:08,790
in weeks two to four,

274
00:07:08,790 --> 00:07:09,750
and it keeps building

275
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:11,730
from there with daily use.

276
00:07:11,730 --> 00:07:13,070
If it doesn't work you
keep

277
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:14,940
it and they still refund
you.

278
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:15,920
The only thing you risk

279
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:16,780
is the time.

280
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:20,180
P.P.P.S. If somebody else
in your house

281
00:07:20,180 --> 00:07:21,680
